---
// Opts the roster and the profile pages into cross-document view transitions,
// so a portrait morphs between the two as the browser navigates. Both pages of
// a navigation must opt in, which is what keeps this to leadership: a link out
// to anywhere else lands without a transition. Browsers without support just
// navigate, and reduced motion leaves it off.
---

<style is:global>
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    @view-transition {
      navigation: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
